### Subscribe EmailAlert observer to AAPL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "observerType": "EmailAlert"
}

###

### Subscribe SmsAlert observer to AAPL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "observerType": "SmsAlert"
}

###

### Subscribe Dashboard observer to AAPL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "observerType": "Dashboard"
}

###

### Subscribe AuditLog observer to AAPL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
