###

### Subscribe EmailAlert to TSLA
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "TSLA",
  "observerType": "EmailAlert"
}

###

### Publish a small price change (no email/sms alerts expected)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": 150.00
}

###

### Publish a 6% price surge (email alert expected, SMS no)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": 159.00
}

###

### Publish a 12% crash (all alert observers fire — email critical, SMS critical)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": 140.00
}

###

### Publish a TSLA price update
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "TSLA",
  "price": 800.00
}

###

### Get all tracked symbols
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/symbols

###

### Get price history for AAPL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/AAPL/history

###

### Get alerts from EmailAlert observer
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/alerts/EmailAlert

###

### Get alerts from SmsAlert observer
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/alerts/SmsAlert

###

### Get alerts from Dashboard observer
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/alerts/Dashboard

###

### Get alerts from AuditLog observer
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/alerts/AuditLog

###

### Get all alerts from all observers
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/alerts

###

### Unsubscribe SmsAlert from AAPL
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/stocks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "observerType": "SmsAlert"
}
